    "text": "Delphi gives agents access to outside services (v1: **Slack, Google Drive, Google Calendar, Gmail, Zoom**) by running the connectors itself, as an MCP client inside the daemon. This replaces the rejected harness-delegated design (Council 005, D-22; `specs/009` §7A)."
